{
  "$comment": [
    "Substrate map for skill-audit.mjs. One entry per installed skill.",
    "",
    "`substrate` is a glob whose EXISTENCE proves the skill has something to act on in this repo.",
    "`null` means the skill is pure behavioural discipline with no artifact — a file check cannot judge it,",
    "and it is reported separately rather than being scored as dead.",
    "",
    "This is DATA, deliberately separate from the script. skill-audit.mjs cross-checks it against",
    ".claude/skills/ and fails loudly on drift, so the map cannot rot silently while looking authoritative.",
    "",
    "Every skill's name + description is injected into the system prompt on EVERY session whether or not it",
    "is ever invoked, so an entry with no substrate is a permanent context tax buying nothing.",
    "Derived 2026-07-28 by reading all 37 SKILL.md files."
